      "text": "Activity 3. Listen to the interview and complete the interviewer's notes."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 9800,
      "end_ms": 14520,
      "text": "Hello Wang Chen. Thanks for coming to the interview."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 15380,
      "end_ms": 23400,
      "text": "Hello. Can you tell us something about the bird last week? Why can't it fly from the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 23400,
      "end_ms": 23840,
      "text": "ground?"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 23840,
      "end_ms": 34200,
      "text": "because it is a swift. These kinds of birds have weak legs so they can't take off from the ground."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 34820,
      "end_ms": 42000,
      "text": "They need to take off from a high place. Why do you know so much about birds?"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 42840,
      "end_ms": 50560,
      "text": "Because I love bird watching. It's my hobby. What do you like about bird watching?"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 50560,
      "end_ms": 60540,
      "text": "My dad takes me to watch birds every summer. I read books about birds too. It helps me know"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 60540,
      "end_ms": 62660,
      "text": "more about the world of nature."
    },
    {
